"Mixing":["Mixing **changes peak timing**","**Never mix glargine, detemir, premixed** with anything","Never mix **pramlintide** + insulin","*(Not in this chapter)* regular + NPH: **clear before cloudy**"],
"Drawing up from a vial (Box 56.5)":["**Roll** NPH (never shake); air = dose into vial; draw; remove bubbles","Site not used in past month; **90°**; **don't rub**","Sharps container, **no recapping** · same syringe type every time","Syringes: **1 mL (100 U)**, **½ mL (50 U)**, **3/10 mL (30 U)**; scales differ"],
"Pens (Box 56.5)":["**Prime until a drop appears**","Press slowly, **hold 6–10 s**","Good for **low vision** (clicks)","**Upside-down display**: 52 ↔ 25, 12 ↔ 21"],
"Pumps and other devices":["**Pump**: hourly basal + boluses; **change set q2–3 days**; **ketones if > 300**","Pump off → hyperglycemia → backup plan","**AID** = pump + CGM + algorithm","**Inhaled**: nonsmokers, no lung disease, PFTs first"],
