"Storage":["**Unopened → fridge** · **in use → room temp ≤ 28 days**","Not < **36°F** or > **86°F**, **never frozen**, no heat/light, no shaking","**Discard after 28 days** · keep a spare","Prefilled syringes ~**30 days** in fridge, **needle up/flat**"],
