"15 g examples (Box 56.11)":["Glucose tabs/gel · **½ cup juice or regular soda** · **5 hard candies**","**4 tsp sugar** · **1 Tbsp honey/syrup**","Symptoms may **outlast the low** → go by the recheck"],
