"Can't swallow — glucagon and dextrose":["**Glucagon** first-line; **side-lying** (vomiting)","**IV dextrose** is hyperosmolar → **watch for extravasation**","Effects wear off → glucose **q15 min**, then for hours; target **70–110**"],
