"Lower airway":["Trachea → R + L mainstem bronchi → bronchioles → alveoli","**Right bronchus is more vertical** → aspiration and a too-deep tube go **right**","Bronchiole smooth muscle **constricts in asthma**","Alveoli lined with **surfactant** → keeps them from collapsing"],
