"Protecting everyone else":["Inpatient: mask, **single room + own bathroom, door closed**; **AIIR for aerosol procedures**","Staff: **N95**, goggles/face shield (glasses not enough), gown, gloves","**MDI + spacer, not nebulizer**","Don: hand hygiene → gown → respirator → shield → gloves over cuffs","Doff: **gloves → gown** (in room) → exit → goggles/shield → **respirator outside** → wash hands","Home: own room/bathroom, 6 ft, masks, few (vaccinated) caregivers, no shared dishes/bedding, disinfect surfaces"],
